# Verification

At the end of meaningful work, verify the affected scope.

Preferred checks:
- TypeScript check
- Lint
- Production build when appropriate
- Affected routes/features
- Relevant forms and interactions

Rules:
- Fix errors caused by the current change.
- Do not disable lint/type checks to make the build pass.
- Do not claim completion without verification.
- If something cannot be verified, state that clearly.
- Do not spend tokens testing unrelated parts of the project.
